{
  "$schema": "../node_modules/@stryker-mutator/core/schema/stryker-schema.json",
  "mutate": [
    "packages/dsh-mcp-manager/src/server/servers/**/*.ts",
    "!packages/dsh-mcp-manager/src/client/**",
    "!packages/dsh-mcp-manager/src/**/interface.ts",
    "!packages/dsh-mcp-manager/src/server/*/deps.ts",
    "!packages/dsh-mcp-manager/src/server/*/*/deps.ts"
  ],
  "testRunner": "vitest",
  "mutator": {
    "excludedMutations": [
      "StringLiteral",
      "ArrayLiteral",
      "ObjectLiteral",
      "TemplateLiteral"
    ]
  },
  "plugins": [
    "@stryker-mutator/vitest-runner"
  ],
  "concurrency": 16,
  "timeoutMS": 60000,
  "dryRunTimeoutMinutes": 5,
  "reporters": [
    "progress",
    "clear-text",
    "json"
  ],
  "coverageAnalysis": "perTest",
  "tempDirName": ".stryker-tmp",
  "cleanTempDir": true,
  "vitest": {
    "related": false,
    "configFile": "vitest.stryker.d/dsh-mcp-manager-servers.config.ts"
  },
  "jsonReporter": {
    "fileName": "coverage/mutation/dsh-mcp-manager-servers.json"
  },
  "incremental": true,
  "incrementalFile": "coverage/mutation/incremental-mcp-manager-servers.json",
  "_comment": "新增（#767 S1-2b）：servers——面向官方引擎的服务器域族（装载生命周期 servers/lifecycle + 派发 servers/dispatch（#767 S1-3a 落地）；injection 不在本段，其实现在 src/server/catalog/impl/injection/）。为什么新建段而不是塞进旧段：源码全覆盖断言要求 src 下每个文件落在 ∪mutate ∪ ∪excludes 内，而 src/server/servers/** 不被既有任何段的 glob 覆盖；旧段的 comment 与文件归属也会因此失真。excludes 照同包其余段，仅保留 client 一条（另一端），不构成宿主侧变异面。测试按段 testFiles 清单跑（perTest 关联）；incremental 基线随 observe 夜间全量班重建（D7 迁移豁免）。"
}
